# Vitest failure screenshots of the measurement runs. This repo has a public
# remote (an unfiltered GitHub mirror) — screenshots do not belong in it, and a
# shot of a measurement is not the measurement. The numbers live in the
# `[672-P0]` console lines of the run itself, reproducible with
#   node scripts/with-test-lock.mjs npx vitest run --config spikes/672/vitest.spike.config.ts
__screenshots__/
*.png
